# `vercel link` wrote these two lines. `.vercel` holds the project id (not a secret).
# `.env*` was narrowed to `.env.local`: as written it also matched `app/.env.example`,
# which is tracked, so a future edit to it would have been silently ignored.
.vercel
.env.local
